			"Message": "docs(Mist): Standardize documentation formatting and update links\n\nRefactor the `Architecture.md` file for `Mist` to align with project-wide documentation standards. Convert block paragraphs into bulleted lists for improved readability and replace inline code references with consistent `PascalCase` formatting for component names (`Mist`, `Land`, `Sky`, `Cocoon`, `Air`, `Mountain`).\n\nAdd section-specific emoji icons (e.g., 🌫️, 📋, 🏗️) to headers and update external documentation links in the `Related Documentation` section to point to the current branch on GitHub, replacing local relative paths with absolute URLs.\n\nEnsure all technical terms like `Rust`, `gRPC`, and `DNSSEC` are consistently capitalized and that the description of the `WebSocket` transport layer accurately reflects its role in `Sky`-to-`Cocoon` communication.",
			"SHA": "41ab78c26552e2307218dc7f60d782484f6a334f"
		},
